{
  "meta": {
    "url": "https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/",
    "description": [
      "启动 COMMAND，若 DURATION 之后仍在运行则将其终止。"
    ]
  },
  "option": [
    {
      "name": "--foreground",
      "alias": [
        "-f"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-f, --foreground"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "当 timeout 不是直接从 shell 提示符运行时，允许 COMMAND 读取 TTY 并接收 TTY 信号；在此模式下 COMMAND 的子进程不会被超时终止"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--kill-after",
      "alias": [
        "-k"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-k, --kill-after <DURATION>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "如果发出初始信号后 COMMAND 仍在运行这么久，再发送一个 KILL 信号"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "1m"
        },
        {
          "name": "1s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--preserve-status",
      "alias": [
        "-p"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-p, --preserve-status"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "即使命令超时，也以 COMMAND 的相同状态码退出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--signal",
      "alias": [
        "-s"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-s, --signal <SIGNAL>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "指定超时时发送的信号；SIGNAL 可以是 'HUP' 这样的名字或数字；信号列表参见 'kill -l'"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--verbose",
      "alias": [
        "-v"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-v, --verbose"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "把超时时发出的任何信号诊断信息输出到标准错误"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "global_option": [
    {
      "name": "--help",
      "tip": [
        "显示此帮助并退出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--version",
      "tip": [
        "输出版本信息并退出"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
